<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107581" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρθῡμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>high-spirited,
				high-minded, daring,</i> freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, in good sense, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.746
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.376
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				937
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				12.103
			</span></i>, etc.: irreg. 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερθυμέστατος ἀνδρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Stesich.
					95
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in bad
			sense, <i>overweening,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				719
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.332
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Hadr.
			</span></i>); <i>over-spirited,</i> of a horse, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				3.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>vehemently angry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.124
			</span></i>. Adv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερθύμως ἄγαν</span>
			<i>in</i> over-<i>vehement wrath,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				824
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> in
				Adv. also, <i>eagerly, readily,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IGRom.
				4.1302.12
			</span></i> (Cyme, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span><span class="entity">/i A. D.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
